{
 "id": "bb-band-walk-01",
 "title": {
  "en": "Band Walk: Fading the Upper Band",
  "bn": "Band walk: upper band-এ উল্টো trade"
 },
 "symbol": "EURUSD",
 "timeframe": "H4",
 "mode": "synthetic",
 "type": "pattern",
 "bias": "bullish",
 "outcome": "loss",
 "tags": [
  "bollinger",
  "trend",
  "band-walk"
 ],
 "module": "07-technical-indicators",
 "lessonSlugs": [
  "05-bollinger-bands"
 ],
 "caption": {
  "en": "In a strong trend price closes on or above the upper band 4 times. A sell at the first touch (bar 25) is stopped out as the walk continues.",
  "bn": "শক্তিশালী trend-এ দাম 4 বার upper band-এর ওপরে বা গায়ে close করে। প্রথম স্পর্শে (25 নম্বর bar) sell করলে stop কাটে, কারণ walk চলতেই থাকে।"
 },
 "notes": {
  "en": "Illustrative synthetic data.",
  "bn": "এটি শিক্ষামূলক কাল্পনিক ডেটা।"
 },
 "explanation": {
  "en": "A touch of the upper band is not a reversal signal. In a trend price can ride the band for many candles.",
  "bn": "Upper band ছোঁয়া reversal signal নয়। Trend-এ দাম অনেক candle ধরে band ধরে চলতে পারে।"
 },
 "keyTakeaways": [
  {
   "en": "Bands measure volatility, not reversal levels",
   "bn": "Band মাপে volatility, reversal level নয়"
  }
 ],
